#X text 35 15 Write a patch that creates arpeggios (3 or more MIDI Notes) of a chord. Create the chords using arithmetic objects to generate the intervals. The root note should randomly change everytime the patch is played. Delay the notes using instances of [pipe] in a chain.;
#X text 37 111 BONUS: Make a MIDI "Echo" by sending the arpeggio through one or more [pipe] instances with longer delay times to [makenotes] with lower velocity settings.;
